        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Solomoni ambĩlĩlya kwaka nyũmba ya Yeova Yelusaleme kĩĩmanĩ kya Molia, vala Yeova wamumĩlĩle Ndaviti ĩthe wake, ĩla waseũvĩsye vandũ vala vatw’ĩtwe nĩ Ndaviti kĩvũĩonĩ kya Olinani Mũyevusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
